sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AM as Agent Maestro
    participant Roo as Roo extension

    Client->>AM: POST /api/v1/roo/task
    AM->>Roo: Start task and forward events
    AM-->>Client: taskCreated / taskStarted
    Roo-->>AM: Partial message updates
    AM-->>Client: message (partial)
    Roo-->>AM: Complete follow-up question
    AM-->>Client: message (ask=followup, partial=false)
    AM-->>Client: HTTP stream ends
    Note over Client,AM: No stream_closed event

    Client->>AM: POST /api/v1/roo/task/{id}/message
    AM->>Roo: Resume/select task as needed and send reply
    Roo-->>AM: Text and tool-interaction messages
    AM-->>Client: message
    opt User approves the intended task operation
        Client->>AM: POST /api/v1/roo/task/{id}/action
        AM->>Roo: pressPrimaryButton
    end
    Roo-->>AM: Task completion notification
    AM-->>Client: taskCompleted (usage)
    Note over Client,AM: Keep reading for final content
    Roo-->>AM: Complete result message
    AM-->>Client: message (say=completion_result, partial=false)
    AM-->>Client: HTTP stream ends
